
==============================================================================
Page intro: no-calculator shortcuts
==============================================================================
  eps0C = 1e-9/36pi = 8.841941e-12 F/m (exact 8.854188e-12); 1/sqrt(mu0 eps0C) = 3e+08 m/s; sqrt(mu0/eps0C) = 376.991118 = 120pi = 376.991118
  sigma/(w eps) = sigma/(2 pi f er eps0C) = sigma*36pi e9/(2 pi f er) = 18e9 sigma/(f er): factor 1.8e+10
  pi f mu0 sigma = 4 pi^2 1e-7 f sigma: pi*mu0 = 3.947842e-06 = 4pi^2 e-7 = 3.947842e-06
  1 Np = 8.6859 dB

