23.4 Skin depth in gold (sigma = 4.1e7 S/m)
==============================================================================
  delta*sqrt(f) = 1/sqrt(pi mu0 sigma) = 0.078601 m*sqrt(Hz); pi mu0 sigma = 161.86; sqrt(60) = 7.7460
  f = 60: delta = 0.01015 m (exact gamma: 0.01015); p = 1.23e+16
  f = 1e+06: delta = 7.86e-05 m (exact gamma: 7.86e-05); p = 7.37e+11
  f = 4e+06: delta = 3.93e-05 m (exact gamma: 3.93e-05); p = 1.84e+11
  f = 1e+10: delta = 7.86e-07 m (exact gamma: 7.86e-07); p = 7.37e+07
  scaling: 78.6 um / sqrt(4) = 39.30 um; 78.6 um / sqrt(1e4) = 0.7860 um
  plating 1.5 um at 10 GHz: 2d/delta = 3.8167; d/delta = 1.9084; power absorbed within it = 1 - e^(-2d/delta) = 0.9780; field left at the back = e^(-d/delta) = 0.1483
  frequency where 1.5 um = 1 delta: f = (0.0786/1.5e-6)^2 = 2.746e+09 Hz
  [gold GC at 10 GHz (exact alpha vs GC within 1e-6)] OK

